Here's a TypeScript type `DeepReadonly<T>` that makes every nested property readonly, including arrays and nested objects:

```typescript
type DeepReadonly<T> = {
  [key in keyof T]: DeepReadonly<keyof T> extends Readonly<keyof T> ? T[key] : DeepReadonly<keyof T>
} & Readonly<T>
```

